  "url": "https://www.creativefabrica.com/product/dynamix-street/",
  "description": "Introducing Dynamix Street, an explosion of 3D artistry in the form of a graffiti-inspired font that infuses your design work with vibrancy and depth. Every stroke of this bold, energetic font conjures the verve and pulse of city life into your creations. Every layer, be it the solid base, the echo-like shadow or the enriching extrude, invokes a sense of momentum while adding an intriguing dimensional aspect. \nThe unique multi-tiered structure of Dynamix Street makes it an absolute powerhouse for projects needing to make an unmistakable visual impact. If you’re seeking to capture the raw, kinetic vibe of street life, this font is the magic ingredient for streetwear designs, album covers, and posters.\n Even when selectively layered, Dynamix Street doesn’t lose an ounce of its intensity, serving up a strikingly immersive 3D experience that complements and enhances the urban vibe. With Dynamix Street, your designs won’t just tell a story – they’ll live it.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Introducing Dynamix Street, an explosion of 3D artistry in the form of a graffiti-inspired font that infuses your design work with vibrancy and depth. Every stroke of this bold, energetic font conjures the verve and pulse of city life into your creations. Every layer, be it the solid base, the echo-like shadow or the enriching extrude, invokes a sense of momentum while adding an intriguing dimensional aspect. </p>\n<p>The unique multi-tiered structure of Dynamix Street makes it an absolute powerhouse for projects needing to make an unmistakable visual impact. If you’re seeking to capture the raw, kinetic vibe of street life, this font is the magic ingredient for streetwear designs, album covers, and posters.</p>\n<p> Even when selectively layered, Dynamix Street doesn’t lose an ounce of its intensity, serving up a strikingly immersive 3D experience that complements and enhances the urban vibe. With Dynamix Street, your designs won’t just tell a story – they’ll live it.</p>",
